      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even know how to describe it anymore. it's not just being tired. it's like... everything is just heavy. every single thing. even breathing feels like a chore i didn't sign up for. i feel like i've been running a marathon for years and i've just finally hit a wall that isn't going anywhere. i'm just so incredibly empty.",
